      "date": "2026-07-10T01:55:03.000Z",
      "summary": "<h1>If you like caching and coding on your Android, you’ll love Crush v0.84.0</h1> <p>This is a mini release with two little niceties:</p> <h2>Cachemaxxing</h2> <p>Crush now sends the fabled <code>x-session-affinity</code> header (and <code>x-session-id</code>) in its requests. Supporting providers can pick the header up, pin the session to a given replica, and go cache wild. The session header is a hash with no personally identifiable information, of course.</p> <h2>Fixed: Termux</h2> <p>If you’re a nerd with an Android, you probably use Termux, the hot Android terminal emulator. If you’re a cool nerd, you probably <em>want</em> to use Crush on an Android and are annoyed that it was broken. Thanks to <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Ricardo-M-L/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Ricardo-M-L\">@Ricardo-M-L</a>, Crush now works on Android again.</p> <p>Hope you're having a great summer! Unless you're in South America, Central America, the Southern part of Mexico, parts of Africa or Australia, in which case…hope you're enjoying the Winter!</p> <p>xoxo,<br> Charm 🍔</p> <h2>Changelog</h2> <h3>New!</h3> <ul> <li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/commit/ebd845c003579484171922fda8a671367eee7684/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/commit/ebd845c003579484171922fda8a671367eee7684\"><tt>ebd845c</tt></a>: feat(agent): send session hash in header for cache affinity (<a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/meowgorithm/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/meowgorithm\">@meowgorithm</a>)</li> </ul> <h3>Fixed</h3> <ul> <li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/commit/5b61432984ba271cf9cb3791295ba94e9c2c8f81/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/commit/5b61432984ba271cf9cb3791295ba94e9c2c8f81\"><tt>5b61432</tt></a>: fix(release): drop broken .termux.deb artifact (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4412859744\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/issues/2848\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/charmbracelet/crush/pull/2848/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/pull/2848\">#2848</a>) (<a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Ricardo-M-L/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Ricardo-M-L\">@Ricardo-M-L</a>)</li> <li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/commit/e3074f14cec703bdddba13e6df5cf2242b34194c/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/commit/e3074f14cec703bdddba13e6df5cf2242b34194c\"><tt>e3074f1</tt></a>: fix(server): show update notices in client-server mode (<a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/meowgorithm/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/meowgorithm\">@meowgorithm</a>)</li> </ul> <hr> <details> <summary>Verifying the artifacts</summary> <p>First, download the <a href=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/releases/download/v0.84.0/checksums.txt\"><code>checksums.txt</code> file</a> and the <a href=\"https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/releases/download/v0.84.0/checksums.txt.sigstore.json\"><code>checksums.txt.sigstore.json</code> file</a> files, for example, with <code>wget</code>:</p> <div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"wget 'https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/releases/download/v0.84.0/checksums.txt' wget 'https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/releases/download/v0.84.0/checksums.txt.sigstore.json'\"><pre>wget <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/releases/download/v0.84.0/checksums.txt<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span> wget <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush/releases/download/v0.84.0/checksums.txt.sigstore.json<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span></pre></div> <p>Then, verify it using <a href=\"https://github.com/sigstore/cosign\"><code>cosign</code></a>:</p> <div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"cosign verify-blob \\ --certificate-identity 'https://github.com/charmbracelet/meta/.github/workflows/goreleaser.yml@refs/heads/main' \\ --certificate-oidc-issuer 'https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com' \\ --bundle 'checksums.txt.sigstore.json' \\ ./checksums.txt\"><pre>cosign verify-blob \\ --certificate-identity <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>https://github.com/charmbracelet/meta/.github/workflows/goreleaser.yml@refs/heads/main<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span> \\ --certificate-oidc-issuer <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span> \\ --bundle <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>checksums.txt.sigstore.json<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span> \\ ./checksums.txt</pre></div> <p>If the output is <code>Verified OK</code>, you can safely use it to verify the checksums of other artifacts you downloaded from the release using <code>sha256sum</code>:</p> <div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"sha256sum --ignore-missing -c checksums.txt\"><pre>sha256sum --ignore-missing -c checksums.txt</pre></div> <p>Done! You artifacts are now verified!</p> </details> <p><a href=\"https://charm.land/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"The Charm logo\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/69664ad4650dabc137df37044e4d9366cfe32124b10f97b798c064aeaef86443/68747470733a2f2f73747566662e636861726d2e73682f636861726d2d62616e6e65722d6e6578742e6a7067\" width=\"400\" data-canonical-src=\"https://stuff.charm.sh/charm-banner-next.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p> <p>Thoughts? Questions? We love hearing from you. Feel free to reach out on <a href=\"https://x.com/charmcli\" rel=\"nofollow\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://charm.land/discord\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>, <a href=\"https://charm.land/slack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slack</a>, <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@charmcli\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Fediverse</a>, <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/charm.land\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bluesky</a>.</p>",
